  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The GEF-funded FARM+ Program (&#x201c;FARM+&#x201d;) aims to unlock finance and build capacity to support governments and agricultural stakeholders in transitioning from unsustainable agricultural practices to sustainable and climate resilient agricultural practices and increase the uptake of nature-based solutions to build the resilience of farming practices to climate change, protect, regenerate and improve productive landscapes and soil health and reduce soil and water pollution from harmful agrochemicals</narrative>
  </description>
